  "description": "Make every ride your best ride.\n\nClimb better and farther.\n\n120Nm of torque and 750W of peak power helps get you places you otherwise couldn't. Whether you're crawling up techy switchbacks or powering through punchy climbs, you’ll appreciate every bit of it.\n\nMore Control. More Confidence.\n\nThe Tetra-Link suspension platform gives you 170mm of rear travel and a confident, active feel—even under braking. Whether you’re charging into rough sections or feathering the brakes through tech, your suspension stays planted and smooth.\n\nTune it to the trail\n\nGA-Link geometry adjustment and 29er or mullet compatibility let you choose between stability and a more playful ride.\n\nRange That Matches Your Ambition\n\nTimp Peak gives you battery options to match your riding style. Choose a 600Wh or 800Wh PowerTube battery and, if you’re chasing extra-long days, add the PowerMore 250Wh range extender.\n\nWhether you're climbing all day or squeezing in a post-work lap, you’ve got the juice to ride how you want, as long as you want.",
